#: components/ReportPage/SectionFeatures.js:152
msgid ""
"An exclusive service keeps users from repeating requests and provides\n"
"immediate information about false messages in the previous queries."
msgstr "專屬服務可防止用戶重複發送請求，並即時提供先前查詢中關於不實訊息的最新資訊。"

#: components/ReportPage/SectionFeatures.js:158
msgid ""
"Volunteers would login Cofacts and fact-check the suspicious messages.\n"
"What fact-checkers have replied and commented would be transparent\n"
"and reviewed, the achievement was opened and shareable."
msgstr ""
"志工登入 Cofacts 平台，對可疑訊息進行事實查核。\\n"
"查核人員的回覆與評論均公開透明並經過審核，其查核成果亦可供大眾瀏覽與分享。"

#: components/ReportPage/SectionFeatures.js:166
msgid ""
"Cofacts has categorized misinformation via topics automatically, making\n"
"different expertise focus on their professional fields. Such as COVID-19,\n"
"Vaccine related, propaganda, public policy, or fraud, these could be\n"
"categorized by Artificial Intelligence."
msgstr "Cofacts 已透過人工智慧自動將不實訊息按議題分類，使不同專長的查核人員能專注於其專業領域。例如 COVID-19、疫苗相關、宣傳、公共政策或詐騙等主題，均可由 AI 進行自動歸類。"

#: components/ReportPage/SectionFeatures.js:174
msgid ""
"Cofacts has provided API connecting instruction, fact-checking system\n"
"since 2016. This achievement leads the combating misinformation ecosystem.\n"
"There were third party chatbots connecting to Cofacts open API and IFCN\n"
"member started to conduct own chatbots."
msgstr "自 2016 年起，Cofacts 便提供了 API 介接指南及事實查核系統。這一成就引領了對抗不實訊息的生態圈發展。隨後，有第三方聊天機器人開始介接 Cofacts 的開放 API，而 IFCN 會員單位也相繼推出了各自的事實查核聊天機器人。"

